      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRING DAZZLER (1) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors four starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (22.90) at this track over 401m. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from four starts. Rates highly and will give a great sight. ZIPPING VIOLET (5) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this trip which boasts two wins and three placings. Hit the frame latest (22.97) when second at this track in a Grade 4/5. Looks a key chance on best figures. WELL KEPT SECRET (2) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split, weakening late to finish a 3.5 lengths fourth (23.10) over 401m at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Should be about the money. BOSTON STRONG (3) has won at this course and distance – sure to figure prominently.",
